<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">Events</h2><ol class="day-events yr-events"><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/heraclius" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/heraclius.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/october-3">3 October</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">Heraclius the Younger's rebel fleet reaches Constantinople</h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The fleet of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/heraclius">Heraclius</a> the Younger, who with his father, the Exarch of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/africa">Africa</a>, had rebelled against Emperor <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/phocas">Phocas</a> in 608, reached <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/constantinople">Constantinople</a>. Heraclius went on to execute Phocas and be proclaimed emperor, founding the Heraclian dynasty.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/heraclius">Heraclius</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/heraclius" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/heraclius.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/october-5">5 October</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">Heraclius is crowned Byzantine emperor</h3><p class="tih-event-desc">Having reached <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/constantinople">Constantinople</a> on 3 October at the head of the revolt against the unpopular emperor <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/phocas">Phocas</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/heraclius">Heraclius</a> was crowned in the Chapel of St Stephen within the Great Palace. He reigned until 641.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/heraclius">Heraclius</a></div></div></li></ol></section>
